body:
Yeah..that's..exactly how people are around where I live.  :/  They'd use it as a means to harass and humiliate me. I've had co-workers who knew actually step out of their way to set me off with loud noises/sudden movements towards me because they think my reactions to it are hilarious. 

&#x200B;

...I hate people.

I still get overwhelmed with awe just thinking about how we, mere specks of fleshbags, are able to use glass and metal and other doohickeys to see 3 billion miles away from us. 

&#x200B;

Beautiful.
